6518848875342582},{"text":"The attack had come from nowhere. They were lucky to","y":0.66234107843721024,"x":0.055250543242298174,"w":0.42830501556396483,"h":0.015243811455054046},{"h":0.011638620268800581,"text":"be alive. As the badly damaged craft 'approached \/ was","x":0.055432392959677973,"w":0.42793788909912112,"y":0.67877906997329085},{"x":0.055432391176603452,"w":0.42793788909912112,"text":"approaching its home planet, it became clear there was","y":0.69328419336592317,"h":0.011657666808557177},{"h":0.011643382001372271,"w":0.42793788909912112,"text":"a major problem here too. The incoming ship ought to","y":0.70784883741515137,"x":0.055432392959677973},{"x":0.053215083794859515,"text":"2be \/ have been contacted by the command centre by now,","y":0.72093023262473577,"h":0.013081395167195309,"w":0.42793788909912106},{"text":"but so far no message 3had been \/ had received. Even more","w":0.42793788909912112,"h":0.011630287529697858,"x":0.055432378768991056,"y":0.73546273527801898},{"w":0.42793788909912112,"y":0.75143325131214511,"h":0.01164814373394385,"text":"worryingly, the spaceport's tracking laser should 4be \/ have","x":0.055432392959677973},{"x":0.055432391176603452,"h":0.011627906468146931,"text":"been switched on by the ground crew several minutes","w":0.42793788909912112,"y":0.76453488393889157},{"y":0.77886977878500085,"x":0.055432392959677973,"w":0.42793788909912112,"text":"earlier, but the battered star cruiser was still Sbeing \/ to be","h":0.011875511875511946},{"x":0.055432382440070427,"h":0.011627906468146931,"y":0.79360465138075209,"text":"controlled manually by the surviving crew.","w":0.31263856887817382},{"text":"Looking out of the forward viewing screen, no lights could","h":0.013277812242312725,"y":0.8110465118822453,"w":0.42572059631347658,"x":0.055432388428627494},{"y":0.82555282559823606,"w":0.43015518188476559,"x":0.053215086607506415,"h":0.011656476473046684,"text":"obe \/ have been seen on the surface of the planet. What 'had"},{"y":0.83865683850238992,"x":0.053215083868769317,"h":0.013104013494543154,"w":0.42793788909912106,"text":"\/ had been happened down there? The growing realisation"},{"x":0.053215083794859515,"h":0.010237510237510294,"w":0.42793788909912106,"text":"that their home planet may also ®be \/ have been attacked","y":0.8546273545698404},{"text":"filled the crew with horror. Their families! Their homes!","y":0.86918604646619979,"x":0.055432382550527813,"w":0.41241683959960945,"h":0.010174418550158548},{"y":0.88656838651388525,"h":0.011875511875511835,"text":"Just when it seemed that all hope was lost, there was","w":0.42793788909912106,"x":0.053215096276381678},{"text":"a crackle, then a faint voice from the communication","x":0.053215096276381678,"y":0.90116279070675198,"w":0.42793788909912106,"h":0.010174418550158659},{"text":"system ... 'Sorry number 6, we just popped out for a coffee","y":0.91564291566651501,"x":0.053215095206536951,"w":0.42793788909912106,"h":0.011875511875511835},{"text":"and lost track of time. Is everything OK up there?'","h":0.013113535788096375,"x":0.053215081203314724,"w":0.37250553131103514,"y":0.92874692901933842},{"y":0.96220930265255433,"text":"102","x":0.035476718891937209,"w":0.042128601074218744,"h":0.011627906468147042},{"w":0.013303768634796209,"x":0.53215077665821164,"y":0.04651162786154861,"h":0.010174418550158548,"text":"3"},{"text":"* * Complete the sentences and the questions with","x":0.55875831871019865,"y":0.045045045026889663,"h":0.014742014742014753,"w":0.41906871795654299},{"y":0.061015560864204565,"text":"the correct passive forms of the verbs in brackets.","h":0.011658857534597611,"x":0.55875831889635774,"w":0.39467849731445315},{"h":0.013170675797895881,"text":"Are you aware that you risk being fined (fine) if you","x":0.58536587020704389,"y":0.079852579852562222,"w":0.38137470245361327},{"text":"download files illegally?","h":0.0131480578610782,"x":0.58536585313563039,"y":0.092956592992868292,"w":0.17960088729858392},{"y":